      "Compares implementation details with related plan files or issue requirements.",
      "Reviews each changed file for bugs, missing validation, poor error handling, and security concerns.",
      "Classifies issues by severity and category for merge decisions.",
      "Produces a structured review report with required fixes and overall assessment."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "It depends on available git history, diff output, and readable plan or issue context.",
